{"3681810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blue Protocol: Star Resonance", "steam_appid": 3681810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/215f022ea7f22c81bc6c172e3574e85c.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue Protocol: Star Resonance S3 launches May 28!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new season, Echoes of Ember, is now live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside new friends and face the unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/b1ba885b2cfcf080d0dcdeba6fa1e104.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/b1ba885b2cfcf080d0dcdeba6fa1e104.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/2ac05903ef5b73612734003768e388bc.poster.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/2ac05903ef5b73612734003768e388bc.webm?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/2ac05903ef5b73612734003768e388bc.mp4?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. New Class: Twin Striker</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An offensive class specializing in close-range combat, wielding dual axes. Their attacks are fast and fiery, with excellent AoE capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/429b468e02ecf661df9b8d9e7a3b2f67.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/429b468e02ecf661df9b8d9e7a3b2f67.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/af986dd55d7b7fe6428e0e23bcd2d2d0.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. New Musician System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks at Lv. 10. The first batch of instruments includes a rock set: guitar, keyboard, bass, and drums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/7ffbeb60e8775988c4dd3c0fbf45bab2.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/7ffbeb60e8775988c4dd3c0fbf45bab2.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. New Season: Echoes of Ember</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange echoes drift through the Chaotic Realm, blurring the line between reality and illusion. Explore 3 new maps and conquer 6 new dungeons in this season’s adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/6f389da8554e52154c75ffb9f4899e2a.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/6f389da8554e52154c75ffb9f4899e2a.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. NPC Bond Stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about Darya, Boyce, and Fafala through the new Bond Story system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/c4c24384307ae9202c62d6be67efdeb0.poster.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/c4c24384307ae9202c62d6be67efdeb0.webm?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/c4c24384307ae9202c62d6be67efdeb0.mp4?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Other Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existing systems have also been updated, including Battle Imagine/ Will Wish, Gear Modification/Class Loot, Instructor system, Fashion/Mount Wish, Homestead, and Life Skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/28b25b24b56a29a5b256331a4f0a9693.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/28b25b24b56a29a5b256331a4f0a9693.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/88bdff942bac166b74bd4e48ad0a9c2c.poster.avif?t=1782796352\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/88bdff942bac166b74bd4e48ad0a9c2c.webm?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/88bdff942bac166b74bd4e48ad0a9c2c.mp4?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/215f022ea7f22c81bc6c172e3574e85c.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue Protocol: Star Resonance S3 launches May 28!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new season, Echoes of Ember, is now live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside new friends and face the unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/b1ba885b2cfcf080d0dcdeba6fa1e104.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/b1ba885b2cfcf080d0dcdeba6fa1e104.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/2ac05903ef5b73612734003768e388bc.poster.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/2ac05903ef5b73612734003768e388bc.webm?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/2ac05903ef5b73612734003768e388bc.mp4?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. New Class: Twin Striker</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An offensive class specializing in close-range combat, wielding dual axes. Their attacks are fast and fiery, with excellent AoE capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/429b468e02ecf661df9b8d9e7a3b2f67.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/429b468e02ecf661df9b8d9e7a3b2f67.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/af986dd55d7b7fe6428e0e23bcd2d2d0.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. New Musician System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks at Lv. 10. The first batch of instruments includes a rock set: guitar, keyboard, bass, and drums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/7ffbeb60e8775988c4dd3c0fbf45bab2.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/7ffbeb60e8775988c4dd3c0fbf45bab2.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. New Season: Echoes of Ember</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange echoes drift through the Chaotic Realm, blurring the line between reality and illusion. Explore 3 new maps and conquer 6 new dungeons in this season’s adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/6f389da8554e52154c75ffb9f4899e2a.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/6f389da8554e52154c75ffb9f4899e2a.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. NPC Bond Stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about Darya, Boyce, and Fafala through the new Bond Story system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/c4c24384307ae9202c62d6be67efdeb0.poster.avif?t=1782796352\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/c4c24384307ae9202c62d6be67efdeb0.webm?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/c4c24384307ae9202c62d6be67efdeb0.mp4?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Other Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existing systems have also been updated, including Battle Imagine/ Will Wish, Gear Modification/Class Loot, Instructor system, Fashion/Mount Wish, Homestead, and Life Skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/28b25b24b56a29a5b256331a4f0a9693.avif?t=1782796352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras_big/28b25b24b56a29a5b256331a4f0a9693.avif?t=1782796352 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/88bdff942bac166b74bd4e48ad0a9c2c.poster.avif?t=1782796352\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/88bdff942bac166b74bd4e48ad0a9c2c.webm?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/extras/88bdff942bac166b74bd4e48ad0a9c2c.mp4?t=1782796352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Blue Protocol: Star Resonance expands the Blue Protocol universe with a vibrant MMORPG experience. Create your own hero, team up for strategic raids, or simply relax and have fun with friends fishing, crafting, and endless exploration. Adventure awaits!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/370bae74290b58f77313f1cb1b928ec4aa429ad1/header.jpg?t=1782796352", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/dd97cadb6ef06bfbebbad26336c01fff5b9f1eb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782796352", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681810/dd97cadb6ef06bfbebbad26336c01fff5b9f1eb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782796352", "website": "https://www.playbpsr.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-8700 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 580 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>